fe and try to put yourself in the exact position you were in five years ago, ten years ago, fifteen years ago, twenty years ago.", "fhl": [25, 33], "zh": "我喜欢做一个小小的思维练习，就是，你可以回到自己的人生里，试着把自己放回五年前、十年前、十五年前、二十年前所处的那个确切位置。", "zb": [11, 13], "sg": [[0, 56, "audio/t05o/s01.mp3", 0, 2.63], [57, 102, "audio/t05o/s02.mp3", 0, 4.15], [103, 165, "audio/t05o/s02.mp3", 4.15, 8.02], [166, 217, "audio/t05o/s02.mp3", 8.02, 10.42]]}}, {"n": 2, "w": "exact", "pos": "adj.", "zh": "完全准确的；一模一样的", "ex": "Exact means completely correct, with no difference at all. The exact position means the very same place you were in back then. We often say the exact same.", "exs": ["I have the exact same phone as you.", "What's the exact time of your appointment?"], "t": 56.35, "tt": {"w": 56.35, "ex": [["Exact", 59.53], ["means", 59.53], ["completely", 59.61], ["correct,", 60.11], ["with", 60.65], ["no", 61.33], ["difference", 61.57], ["at", 61.93], ["all.", 62.19], ["The", 63.21], ["exact", 63.27], ["position", 63.47], ["means", 64.15], ["the", 64.41], ["very", 64.71], ["same", 65.01], ["place", 65.37], ["you", 65.81], ["were", 65.94], ["in", 66.06], ["back", 66.19], ["then.", 66.31], ["We", 67.17], ["often", 67.53], ["say", 67.75], ["the", 68.15], ["exact", 68.35], ["same.", 68.55]], "exs": [[["I", 72.24], ["have", 72.33], ["the", 72.49], ["exact", 72.63], ["same", 72.85], ["phone", 73.31], ["as", 73.67], ["you.", 73.87]], [["What's", 80.77], ["the", 81.05], ["exact", 81.15], ["time", 81.31], ["of", 81.91], ["your", 82.07], ["appointment?", 82.17]]], "z": [74.77, 83.49], "r": [77.35, 86.28], "o": 89.6, "rx": [[77.35, 77.44, 77.6, 77.74, 77.96, 78.42, 78.78, 78.98], [86.28, 86.56, 86.66, 86.82, 87.42, 87.58, 87.68]]}, "src": {"t": "you can go back into your own life and try to put yourself in the exact position you were in five years ago, ten years ago, fifteen years ago, twenty years ago.", "a": "audio/t05/s02.mp3", "hl": [66, 71], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t05o/s02.mp3", "oab": [4.15, 8.02], "oas": ["audio/t05o/s01.mp3", "audio/t05o/s02.mp3"], "ft": "There’s a little thought exercise I like to do which is, you can go back into your own life and try to put yourself in the exact position you were in five years ago, ten years ago, fifteen years ago, twenty years ago.", "fhl": [123, 128], "zh": "我喜欢做一个小小的思维练习，就是，你可以回到自己的人生里，试着把自己放回五年前、十年前、十五年前、二十年前所处的那个确切位置。", "sg": [[0, 56, "audio/t05o/s01.mp3", 0, 2.63], [57, 102, "audio/t05o/s02.mp3", 0, 4.15], [103, 165, "audio/t05o/s02.mp3", 4.15, 8.02], [166, 217, "audio/t05o/s02.mp3", 8.02, 10.42]]}}, {"n": 3, "w": "objective", "pos": "n.", "zh": "目标（想要达到的结果）", "ex": "An objective is a goal, something you want to get or reach. It is like goal, but it sounds a little more serious and clear. Naval asks what your objectives were back then.", "exs": ["My main objective this year is to get more regular clients.", "What's the objective of this meeting?"], "t": 104.18, "tt": {"w": 104.18, "ex": [["An", 107.05], ["objective", 107.05], ["is", 107.26], ["a", 107.88], ["goal,", 107.98], ["something", 108.82], ["you", 109.0], ["want", 109.26], ["to", 109.44], ["get", 109.58], ["or", 109.76], ["reach.", 109.98], ["It", 110.24], ["is", 111.78], ["like", 111.78], ["goal,", 111.78], ["but", 112.16], ["it", 112.16], ["sounds", 112.3], ["a", 112.5], ["little", 112.8], ["more", 112.92], ["serious", 113.45], ["and", 113.98], ["clear.", 113.98], ["Naval", 115.24], ["asks", 115.24], ["what", 115.74], ["your", 116.18], ["objectives", 116.32], ["were", 116.74], ["back", 117.24], ["then.", 117.5]], "exs": [[["My", 120.82], ["main", 120.87], ["objective", 121.06], ["this", 121.78], ["year", 122.12], ["is", 122.48], ["to", 122.98], ["get", 123.14], ["more", 123.3], ["regular", 123.5], ["clients.", 123.76]], [["What's", 134.07], ["the", 134.28], ["objective", 134.4], ["of", 134.78], ["this", 135.22], ["meeting?", 135.36]]], "z": [125.22, 136.48], "r": [128.75, 139.12], "o": 142.13, "rx": [[128.75, 128.8, 128.99, 129.71, 130.05, 130.41, 130.91, 131.07, 131.23, 131.43, 131.69], [139.12, 139.33, 139.45, 139.83, 140.27, 140.41]]}, "src": {"t": "You try to remember who was I with, what was I doing, what was I feeling, what were my emotions, what were my objectives,", "a": "audio/t05/s03.mp3", "hl": [110, 120], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t05o/s03.mp3", "oab": [5.3, 6.25], "oas": ["audio/t05o/s03.mp3", "audio/t05o/s04.mp3"], "ft": "You try to remember who was I with, what was I doing, what was I feeling, what were my emotions, what were my objectives, and really try to transport yourself back and see if there’s any advice you’d give yourself, anything you’d do differently.", "fhl": [110, 120], "zh": "你试着回想：我当时和谁在一起，我在做什么，我有什么感受，我的情绪是什么，我的目标是什么，真的试着把自己带回那时，看看有没有什么建议想给当时的自己，有没有什么会换种做法。", "zb": [38, 40], "sg": [[0, 35, "audio/t05o/s03.mp3", 0, 2.1], [36, 53, "audio/t05o/s03.mp3", 2.1, 2.91], [54, 73, "audio/t05o/s03.mp3", 2.91, 4.07], [74, 96, "audio/t05o/s03.mp3", 4.07, 5.3], [97, 121, "audio/t05o/s03.mp3", 5.3, 6.25], [122, 163, "audio/t05o/s04.mp3", 0.08, 2.56], [164, 214, "audio/t05o/s04.mp3", 2.86, 5.04], [215, 245, "audio/t05o/s04.mp3", 5.06, 6.29]]}}, {"n": 4, "w": "transport", "pos": "v.", "zh": "把（人/东西）从一个地方带到另一个地方", "ex": "To transport means to move someone or something from one place to another. Here, transport yourself back means to imagine you are back in that time. It is like taking your mind on a trip.", "exs": ["This song always transports me back to high school.", "The boxes were transported by truck."], "t": 156.28, "tt": {"w": 156.28, "ex": [["To", 159.08], ["transport", 159.08], ["means", 159.28], ["to", 159.82], ["move", 160.16], ["someone", 160.3], ["or", 160.66], ["something", 161.02], ["from", 161.32], ["one", 161.68], ["place", 161.88], ["to", 162.2], ["another.", 162.93], ["Here,", 163.66], ["transport", 163.98], ["yourself", 164.66], ["back", 165.04], ["means", 165.54], ["to", 165.84], ["imagine", 166.12], ["you", 166.6], ["are", 166.92], ["back", 167.06], ["in", 167.34], ["that", 167.54], [