acation tonight."], "t": 208.08, "tt": {"w": 208.08, "ex": [["To", 210.81], ["pretend", 210.81], ["means", 210.99], ["to", 211.47], ["act", 211.79], ["like", 212.01], ["something", 212.25], ["is", 212.59], ["true", 212.85], ["when", 213.11], ["it", 213.45], ["isn't.", 213.55], ["Naval", 214.61], ["says", 214.81], ["don't", 215.61], ["pretend", 215.93], ["you", 216.25], ["could", 216.57], ["go", 216.71], ["back", 216.93], ["and", 217.25], ["buy", 217.43], ["Bitcoin.", 217.67], ["Kids", 218.89], ["often", 219.07], ["pretend", 219.43], ["to", 219.91], ["be", 220.27], ["animals", 220.45], ["or", 220.63], ["superheroes.", 221.15]], "exs": [[["He", 225.21], ["pretended", 225.31], ["he", 226.19], ["didn't", 226.24], ["hear", 226.43], ["me.", 226.65]], [["Let's", 233.69], ["pretend", 233.87], ["we're", 234.17], ["on", 234.81], ["vacation", 234.97], ["tonight.", 235.35]]], "z": [227.63, 236.61], "r": [230.3, 239.35], "o": 242.87, "rx": [[230.3, 230.4, 231.28, 231.33, 231.52, 231.74], [239.35, 239.53, 239.83, 240.47, 240.63, 241.01]]}, "src": {"t": "Now you don’t have new information, don’t pretend you could have gone back and bought a stock or bought Bitcoin or whatever,", "a": "audio/t05/s05.mp3", "hl": [42, 49], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t05o/s05.mp3", "oab": [1.52, 4.15], "oas": ["audio/t05o/s05.mp3", "audio/t05o/s06.mp3"], "ft": "Now you don’t have new information, don’t pretend you could have gone back and bought a stock or bought Bitcoin or whatever, but just knowing what you know now in terms of your temperament and a little bit of age-related experience, how would you have done things differently?", "fhl": [42, 49], "zh": "注意，你没有新的信息，别假装你能回到过去买某只股票、买比特币之类的，而是只凭你现在对自己性情的了解，再加上一点随年龄增长的阅历，你当时会怎么换种方式做事？", "zb": [12, 14], "sg": [[0, 35, "audio/t05o/s05.mp3", 0, 1.52], [36, 93, "audio/t05o/s05.mp3", 1.52, 4.15], [94, 124, "audio/t05o/s05.mp3", 4.15, 5.86], [125, 176, "audio/t05o/s06.mp3", 0.08, 3.06], [177, 232, "audio/t05o/s06.mp3", 3.06, 6.86], [233, 276, "audio/t05o/s06.mp3", 7.74, 9.46]]}}, {"n": 6, "w": "stock", "pos": "n.", "zh": "股票", "ex": "A stock is a small part of a company that you can buy. If the company does well, your stock can go up in value. People buy stocks to make money over time.", "exs": ["She bought some Apple stock years ago.", "Stock prices went down today."], "t": 259.63, "tt": {"w": 259.63, "ex": [["A", 262.23], ["stock", 262.23], ["is", 262.49], ["a", 262.83], ["small", 262.95], ["part", 263.19], ["of", 263.61], ["a", 263.73], ["company", 263.81], ["that", 264.13], ["you", 264.47], ["can", 264.65], ["buy.", 264.79], ["If", 265.81], ["the", 266.05], ["company", 266.17], ["does", 266.39], ["well,", 266.69], ["your", 267.57], ["stock", 267.63], ["can", 267.93], ["go", 268.27], ["up", 268.59], ["in", 268.78], ["value.", 268.97], ["People", 269.43], ["buy", 269.88], ["stocks", 270.13], ["to", 270.59], ["make", 270.78], ["money", 271.1], ["over", 271.49], ["time.", 271.81]], "exs": [[["She", 275.45], ["bought", 275.64], ["some", 275.98], ["Apple", 276.22], ["stock", 276.5], ["years", 276.79], ["ago.", 277.08]], [["Stock", 285.22], ["prices", 285.54], ["went", 285.91], ["down", 286.17], ["today.", 286.44]]], "z": [278.04, 287.48], "r": [281.66, 289.76], "o": 292.62, "rx": [[281.66, 281.85, 282.19, 282.43, 282.71, 283.0, 283.29], [289.76, 290.08, 290.45, 290.71, 290.98]]}, "src": {"t": "Now you don’t have new information, don’t pretend you could have gone back and bought a stock or bought Bitcoin or whatever,", "a": "audio/t05/s05.mp3", "hl": [88, 93], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t05o/s05.mp3", "oab": [1.52, 4.15], "oas": ["audio/t05o/s05.mp3", "audio/t05o/s06.mp3"], "ft": "Now you don’t have new information, don’t pretend you could have gone back and bought a stock or bought Bitcoin or whatever, but just knowing what you know now in terms of your temperament and a little bit of age-related experience, how would you have done things differently?", "fhl": [88, 93], "zh": "注意，你没有新的信息，别假装你能回到过去买某只股票、买比特币之类的，而是只凭你现在